OL,3,GNEWSASerial Greggs shoplifter avoids
OL,4,Ajail
OL,5,
OL,6,FA serial shoplifter who stole #2,000
OL,7,Fworth of soft drinks from a south
OL,8,FLondon branch of Greggs has been given
OL,9,Fa suspended jail term, to the
OL,10,Fdisappointment of the Met Police.
OL,12,FTiffany O'Neill, 28, has been arrested,
OL,13,Fcharged and remanded to court 11 times
OL,14,Fsince May, the Met said. She was
OL,15,Frepeatedly released despite breaching
OL,16,Fher bail conditions and returning to
OL,17,Fthe same Greggs in Brixton, the force
OL,18,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
