OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSASerial Greggs shoplifter avoids
OL,4,Ajail
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Wednesday, she was sentenced at
OL,7,FCroydon Magistrates' Court, having
OL,8,Fadmitted 80 offences. She received a
OL,9,F26-week jail sentence, suspended for a
OL,10,Fyear.
OL,12,FSgt Chris Wilkinson said it was
OL,13,F"obviously a disappointment that
OL,14,Fsomeone we know has reoffended so
OL,15,Ffrequently is now back out in the
OL,16,Fcommunity".
